{"4438490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tricky Little Thief", "steam_appid": 4438490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump</strong>, <strong>slide</strong> and <strong>launch</strong> your way through a floating kingdom <strong>stealing</strong> whatever you find along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your <strong>bow</strong> and a wide variety of movement techniques to get to the <strong>chest</strong> as fast as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438490/extras/cb3f0d1f3d4193ba1903a72bb1b3a2d1.poster.avif?t=1774479406\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438490/extras/cb3f0d1f3d4193ba1903a72bb1b3a2d1.webm?t=1774479406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438490/extras/cb3f0d1f3d4193ba1903a72bb1b3a2d1.mp4?t=1774479406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lowering your times will test both your <strong>aim</strong> and <strong>movement </strong>skills. Defeating <strong>enemies</strong> and securing <strong>chests</strong> will lower your times and will grant the thief a gold powered <strong>boost</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steal</strong> (ehem) Collect <strong>hidden coins</strong> as you explore each level. Some are harder to reach than others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438490/extras/badb3497978d4cbb199944a894ca565b.poster.avif?t=1774479406\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438490/extras/badb3497978d4cbb199944a894ca565b.webm?t=1774479406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438490/extras/badb3497978d4cbb199944a894ca565b.mp4?t=1774479406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Gameplay Overview</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3, 2, 1, <strong>Steal!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rush to the final chest, aim for the lock and fire to break into the chest and complete the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies, unlock extra chests and explore different routes to reduce your time and unlock new levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Features</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced platforming action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide variety of movement mechanics including Sliding, Climbing, Wall jumping and Balancing!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectable coins which will test not just your movement skills but also your aim</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple enemy types</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump</strong>, <strong>slide</strong> and <strong>launch</strong> your way through a floating kingdom <strong>stealing</strong> whatever you find along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your <strong>bow</strong> and a wide variety of movement techniques to get to the <strong>chest</strong> as fast as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438490/extras/cb3f0d1f3d4193ba1903a72bb1b3a2d1.poster.avif?t=1774479406\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438490/extras/cb3f0d1f3d4193ba1903a72bb1b3a2d1.webm?t=1774479406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438490/extras/cb3f0d1f3d4193ba1903a72bb1b3a2d1.mp4?t=1774479406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lowering your times will test both your <strong>aim</strong> and <strong>movement </strong>skills. Defeating <strong>enemies</strong> and securing <strong>chests</strong> will lower your times and will grant the thief a gold powered <strong>boost</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steal</strong> (ehem) Collect <strong>hidden coins</strong> as you explore each level. Some are harder to reach than others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438490/extras/badb3497978d4cbb199944a894ca565b.poster.avif?t=1774479406\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438490/extras/badb3497978d4cbb199944a894ca565b.webm?t=1774479406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438490/extras/badb3497978d4cbb199944a894ca565b.mp4?t=1774479406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Gameplay Overview</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3, 2, 1, <strong>Steal!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rush to the final chest, aim for the lock and fire to break into the chest and complete the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies, unlock extra chests and explore different routes to reduce your time and unlock new levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Features</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced platforming action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide variety of movement mechanics including Sliding, Climbing, Wall jumping and Balancing!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectable coins which will test not just your movement skills but also your aim</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple enemy types</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "An action packed platformer set in a floating kingdom with a very vocal protagonist. Battle bumbling enemies, collect hidden coins and master your movement to set low times and unlock new levels.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438490/099588dcff098e80becd239cd335506b3539e308/header.jpg?t=1774479406", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438490/80204ebeb6fce4049d9248dffc83f62c9d0fcb1e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774479406", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4438490/80204ebeb6fce4049d9248dffc83f62c9d0fcb1e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774479406", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core Ultra 5 / Ryz